 en from Navi Mumbai\, IN.\nThe Moon is 40° up · daylight\, Sun +20°.\nT
 imes for the Moon's mean limb\, ±2 s.\nMap\, timings and the view at the 
 Moon's edge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=19.0368&lon=73.
 0158
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=19.0368&lon=73.0158
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
